<p>Yeh Ro Kay Boli Sakina (Sa) Chacha Chale Aao Hai Chane Wala Andhera Chacha Chale Aao</p>

<p>Adu Ne Aag Lagi Di Hamare Khaimon Main  Hai Shola Khaimon Se Uthta Chacha Chale Aao</p>

<p>Nikale Kis Tarah Bhaiyya Ko Jalte Khaimon Se  Phuphi Ka Bus Nahi Chalta Chacha Chale Aao</p>

<p>Zameen E Garm Peh Uryan Hai Lash Baba Ki  Uthane Un Ka Janaza Chacha Chale Aao</p>

<p>Hamare Sar Se Laeeno Ne Cheen Li Chadar  Alam Ka Le Kay Pharaira Chacha Chalo Aao</p>

<p>Dekha Kay Shimr Bahata Hai Mashk Se Pani  Magar Mujhe Nahi Deta Chacha Chale Aao</p>